    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel temporary. it feels like the person who actually mattered... the person who had a future and a purpose... that person is actually dead. i'm just the leftover parts. it feels like trying to rebuild a house after it's been burned to the ground. what's even the point in trying to scrape the ashes together?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
